<br>
Doing the Most Good</h5>
			<p style="text-align:center;"><em>“Your days at the most cannot be very long,&nbsp;so use them to the best of your ability&nbsp;for the glory of God and the benefit of your generation.”</em></p>
			<p style="text-align:center;"><strong>- General William Booth, Founder</strong></p>
